## Signs de leak
- App slow después de tiempo en uso
- Browser tab uses growing RAM
- Eventually crash / freeze

## Common causes

### 1. Dialogs not destroyed
```javascript
onPress: function() {
    var oDialog = new Dialog({ ... });
    oDialog.open();
    // NO destroy después de close!
}
```

Each press creates dialog, never freed.

**Fix**:
```javascript
onPress: function() {
    if (!this._oDialog) {
        this._oDialog = new Dialog({ ... });
        this.getView().addDependent(this._oDialog);
    }
    this._oDialog.open();
},
onExit: function() {
    if (this._oDialog) this._oDialog.destroy();
}
```

### 2. Timers not cleared
```javascript
onInit: function() {
    this._timer = setInterval(() => { ... }, 1000);
    // Timer keeps running after view destroyed!
}
```

**Fix**:
```javascript
onExit: function() {
    clearInterval(this._timer);
}
```

### 3. Event subscribers
```javascript
sap.ui.getCore().getEventBus().subscribe('channel', 'event', this._handler, this);
// If not unsubscribed, this reference held
```

**Fix**:
```javascript
onExit: function() {
    sap.ui.getCore().getEventBus().unsubscribe('channel', 'event', this._handler, this);
}
```

### 4. Model references
```javascript
this._oExternalModel = new JSONModel();
// Never destroyed
```

**Fix**:
```javascript
onExit: function() {
    if (this._oExternalModel) this._oExternalModel.destroy();
}
```

### 5. Router listeners
```javascript
this.getRouter().attachRouteMatched(this._handler, this);
// If view destroyed, listener still fires
```

**Fix**:
```javascript
onExit: function() {
    this.getRouter().detachRouteMatched(this._handler, this);
}
```

## Detection tools

### Chrome DevTools Memory tab
1. Open Memory
2. Take heap snapshot (before)
3. Do repeated operations (open+close dialog N times)
4. Take heap snapshot (after)
5. Compare — see retained objects growing

### Performance profiler
- Record session
- Analyze memory over time
- Look for upward trend

### Chrome Task Manager
Shift+Esc → see per-tab memory. Baseline vs after usage.

## Programmatic monitoring
```javascript
setInterval(() => {
    if (performance.memory) {
        console.log('Heap:', (performance.memory.usedJSHeapSize / 1024 / 1024).toFixed(2), 'MB');
    }
}, 10000);
```

## Life cycle discipline
1. **Every `new`** en controller → set as property (`this._something`)
2. **Every event subscribe** → detach in onExit
3. **Every timer** → clear in onExit
4. **Every dialog** → destroy in onExit or reuse via addDependent

## addDependent pattern
```javascript
this._dialog = new Dialog({ ... });
this.getView().addDependent(this._dialog);
```

When view destroyed → dialog auto-destroyed. Best practice.

## Third-party libs
If using external libs (jQuery, D3), ensure they cleanup en view exit.

## Best practices
- **Test long sessions** — 1 hour+ of use
- **Memory profile** every major release
- **Code review** para leaks patterns
- **Unit tests** — create/destroy view repeatedly

## When leaks unavoidable
Enterprise apps con long-running sessions:
- Periodic full-page refresh (soft)
- User notification 'Session expiring — please refresh'
- Background workers on separate service worker (isolated memory)

## UI namespace

### UI.LineItem
Columns en List Report table:
```cds
annotate Products with @(UI.LineItem: [
    { $Type: 'UI.DataField', Value: name, Label: 'Nombre' },
    { $Type: 'UI.DataField', Value: price, Label: 'Precio' },
    { $Type: 'UI.DataFieldForAction', Label: 'Approve', Action: 'CatalogService.approve' }
]);
```

### UI.HeaderInfo
Header en Object Page:
```cds
annotate Products with @(UI.HeaderInfo: {
    TypeName: 'Product',
    TypeNamePlural: 'Products',
    Title: { $Type: 'UI.DataField', Value: name },
    Description: { $Type: 'UI.DataField', Value: category }
});
```

### UI.Facets
Sections en Object Page:
```cds
annotate Products with @(UI.Facets: [
    { $Type: 'UI.CollectionFacet', Label: 'General', Facets: [
        { $Type: 'UI.ReferenceFacet', Target: '@UI.FieldGroup#Main' }
    ]},
    { $Type: 'UI.ReferenceFacet', Label: 'Prices', Target: '@UI.FieldGroup#Prices' }
]);
```

### UI.FieldGroup
Group of fields:
```cds
annotate Products with @(UI.FieldGroup #Main: {
    Label: 'General Info',
    Data: [
        { $Type: 'UI.DataField', Value: name },
        { $Type: 'UI.DataField', Value: description },
        { $Type: 'UI.DataField', Value: category }
    ]
});
```

### UI.SelectionFields
Filter fields en List Report:
```cds
annotate Products with @(UI.SelectionFields: [ category, price ]);
```

### UI.PresentationVariant
Default sort/filter:
```cds
annotate Products with @(UI.PresentationVariant: {
    SortOrder: [{ Property: name }],
    Visualizations: ['@UI.LineItem']
});
```

### UI.Chart
Analytical chart:
```cds
annotate Products with @(UI.Chart: {
    ChartType: #Column,
    Dimensions: [category],
    Measures: [price]
});
```

### UI.Badge
Badge display en tile:
```cds
annotate Products with @(UI.Badge: {
    Title: { $Type: 'UI.DataField', Value: name },
    HeadLine: { $Type: 'UI.DataField', Value: category }
});
```

### UI.DataFieldWithUrl
Link field:
```cds
{ $Type: 'UI.DataFieldWithUrl', Value: name, Url: url }
```

### UI.DataFieldForAction
Button for action:
```cds
{ $Type: 'UI.DataFieldForAction', Label: 'Approve', Action: 'CatalogService.approve' }
```

## Common namespace

### Common.Label
```cds
annotate Products with { name @(Common.Label: 'Product Name'); };
```

### Common.SemanticObject
Cross-navigation:
```cds
annotate Products with { id @(Common.SemanticObject: 'Product'); };
```

### Common.ValueList
Value help (dropdown):
```cds
annotate Products with { category @(Common.ValueList: {
    CollectionPath: 'Categories',
    Parameters: [
        { $Type: 'Common.ValueListParameterInOut', LocalDataProperty: category, ValueListProperty: 'ID' }
    ]
}); };
```

### Common.Text
Descriptive text next to key:
```cds
annotate Products with { categoryID @(Common.Text: categoryName); };
```

## Analytics namespace

### Analytics.AggregatedProperty
Computed measure:
```cds
annotate Sales with @(Analytics.AggregatedProperty #TotalRevenue: {
    Name: 'totalRevenue',
    AggregationMethod: 'sum',
    AggregatableProperty: revenue
});
```

## Semantics namespace

### Semantics.Country
```cds
annotate Address with { country @(Semantics.Country); };
```

### Semantics.PhoneNumber
```cds
annotate Contact with { phone @(Semantics.PhoneNumber); };
```

### Semantics.EmailAddress
```cds
annotate Contact with { email @(Semantics.EmailAddress); };
```

## Full example
```cds
service CatalogService {
    entity Products as projection on my.Products;
}

annotate CatalogService.Products with @(
    UI: {
        LineItem: [
            { Value: name },
            { Value: category },
            { Value: price }
        ],
        HeaderInfo: {
            TypeName: 'Product',
            Title: { Value: name }
        },
        SelectionFields: [ category ],
        Facets: [
            { $Type: 'UI.ReferenceFacet', Label: 'Details', Target: '@UI.FieldGroup#Main' }
        ],
        FieldGroup #Main: {
            Data: [
                { Value: description },
                { Value: category },
                { Value: price }
            ]
        }
    }
);
```

