## Gotchas comunes

### 1. Async antipattern
```javascript
// Bad
var data = null;
oModel.read('/Products', {
    success: (d) => { data = d; }
});
return data;  // Undefined! Not yet loaded
```

### Fix con Promises
```javascript
function loadProducts() {
    return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {
        oModel.read('/Products', {
            success: resolve,
            error: reject
        });
    });
}

const data = await loadProducts();
```

### 2. Binding stale after model change
```javascript
oModel.setData({ ... });  // Complete replacement
// Bindings may not update if you replace entire model
```

### Fix
```javascript
oModel.setProperty('/products', newArray);
// Or
oModel.updateBindings(true);
```

### 3. Controller `this` confusion
```javascript
someArray.forEach(function(item) {
    this.something();  // 'this' is not controller
});
```

### Fix con arrow function
```javascript
someArray.forEach((item) => {
    this.something();  // 'this' is controller
});
// Or
someArray.forEach(function(item) {
    this.something();
}.bind(this));
```

### 4. Dialog opened multiple times
```javascript
onPress: function() {
    const dialog = new Dialog();
    dialog.open();  // New each time!
}
```

### Fix con reuse
```javascript
onPress: function() {
    if (!this._dialog) {
        this._dialog = new Dialog();
        this.getView().addDependent(this._dialog);
    }
    this._dialog.open();
}
```

### 5. i18n hardcoded fallback
```xml
<Text text='{i18n>welcomeMsg}'/>
<!-- If i18n key missing, shows 'welcomeMsg' literally -->
```

### Fix
Ensure all i18n keys exist en `.properties`.

### 6. OData model destroyed prematurely
```javascript
onExit: function() {
    this.getView().getModel().destroy();  // Destroys shared model!
}
```

### Fix
Don't destroy models unless you created them locally.

### 7. Manifest routes conflict
```json
// pattern 'products' vs 'products/{id}'
// Order matters! First match wins.
```

### Fix
Order from most specific to least:
```json
['products/create', 'products/{id}/edit', 'products/{id}', 'products']
```

### 8. Model updates not propagating
```javascript
oContext.setProperty('name', 'X');
// UI might not update in some binding modes
```

### Fix
Use two-way binding OR:
```javascript
oModel.updateBindings(true);
```

### 9. Table not scrolling
```xml
<Table height='100%'>  <!-- May not work en Page -->
```

### Fix
Use `growingScrollToLoad='true'` o wrap en `ScrollContainer`.

### 10. Password field visible
```xml
<Input value='{password}'/>  <!-- Shows password in plain text -->
```

### Fix
```xml
<Input type='Password' value='{password}'/>
```

## Patterns established

### MVC discipline
- View: XML, declarative
- Controller: JS, imperative
- Model: data + state

Don't cross boundaries.

### Fragment reuse
```javascript
_getDialog: function() {
    return this._dialog || (this._dialog = sap.ui.xmlfragment(...));
}
```

### Utility functions
Formatters, helpers en separate files:
```javascript
// util/formatter.js
sap.ui.define(() => ({
    price: (v) => (v == null ? '' : v.toFixed(2))
}));
```

### Error handling en OData
```javascript
oModel.attachRequestFailed((oEvent) => {
    const message = oEvent.getParameter('response').message;
    sap.m.MessageBox.error(message);
});
```

### Loading indicators
```javascript
async onLoad() {
    this.getView().setBusy(true);
    try {
        await loadData();
    } finally {
        this.getView().setBusy(false);
    }
}
```

### Beforeunload guard
```javascript
window.addEventListener('beforeunload', (e) => {
    if (oModel.hasPendingChanges()) {
        e.preventDefault();
        return '';
    }
});
```

## Best practices summary
- **Read Fiori design guidelines** before coding
- **Use Fiori Elements** when applicable (less code)
- **Test on real devices** — mobile-first
- **Accessibility** — semantic HTML, ARIA
- **Performance** — bundle, cache, paginate
- **Security** — CSP, sanitize inputs
- **Consistent patterns** — establish team conventions
